      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ray Cooke Lettings are delighted to present this stunning 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom semi-detached house to the rental market in the highly sought-after Oakdale Close, Ballycullen, Dublin 24.\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this spacious family home offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, spacious sitting room, fully fitted kitchen and dining area, and a convenient guest WC. Upstairs, the property offers three generously sized bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, along with a main family bathroom.\nThe property further benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows, quality furnishings, and designated parking.\nOakdale Close is ideally situated close to a wide range of local amenities, with Woodstown Shopping Centre within easy reach. The property is also conveniently located for a selection of excellent schools, childcare facilities, parks, sports and leisure amenities. \nThe nearby 15 and 15B bus routes provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre, while the M50 is easily accessible for commuters travelling throughout Dublin and the wider road network.\nKey Features:\n•3 spacious bedrooms\n•3 bathrooms\n•Master bedroom with ensuite\n•Fully furnished\n•Excellent condition throughout\n•Spacious sitting room\n•Fully fitted kitchen and dining area\n•Gas-fired central heating\n•Double-glazed windows\n•Guest WC\n•Off street parking\n•Secure and popular residential development\n•Excellent public transport links\n•Easy access to the M50\n•Close to Woodstown Shopping Centre\n•Conveniently located for schools, shops and leisure facilities\nIf you are interested in arranging a viewing, please reply to this email with your contact details and a member of the Ray Cooke Lettings team will be in touch with further information\n"
      },
